  <bioghist id="de7a7d1982d020b3fcf65265e27293dc">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p>The Pilgrim Trust was established by Edward S. Harkness in 1930, with an endowment of 2 million pound sterling.
The stated mission of the Trust was to assist Great Britian and Northern Ireland with "urgent needs".</p>  </bioghist>
  <scopecontent id="8ee87be5814ef651ce81afc2f4d37e30">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Pilgrim Trust records primarily consist of Annual Reports, Minutes, and a variety of newspaper clippings.</p>  </scopecontent>
